# Fatal Push, revolt: "Destroy that creature if it has mana value 4 or less instead if a permanent left the battlefield
# under your control this turn." On turn 3 Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Ornithopter (a permanent leaving under its
# control), then pushes Bot2's Auriok Salvagers (mana value 4): it dies. On turn 5 it does the same with a second
# Ornithopter and pushes Bot2's Golos (mana value 5): it survives, the revolt limit being 4.

